    #
    # Named `gate_*` on purpose: this shim declares ONE signature per method
    # name for the whole :test target, so `blocked?` or `outcome` would collide
    # with any other spec wanting those words. Both are concrete — the
    # predicate genuinely returns a bool, and the failure-message builder
    # genuinely returns a String (its `response.nil?` arm returns a literal).
